1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,610
They say I sleep twenty hours a day. Rude.

2
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:13,910
Scientists tracked wild sloths. We sleep about ten hours.

3
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:19,530
Sloths in zoos sleep more, because they're bored.

4
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:26,120
My leafy food is low in calories. So I save energy.

5
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:30,000
It's not laziness. It's a lifestyle.
